# Mirrored esphome fleet — read-only reference, source-of-truth in laris-co repos.
# Excluded from commits because upstream working trees contain real secrets that
# weren't gitignored at source (wifi/mqtt passwords, API keys, OTA passwords, hostnames).
# Anchored to repo root: this guards the mirror only. Our own clean esphome/ folders
# elsewhere (e.g. lab/esp32-wasm-submission/esphome/) are NOT the mirror and stay tracked.
/esphome/

# Claude Code runtime state
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock

